        "Description": "Good afternoon 47!\r\rYour next targets are three yakuza enforcers who brutally tortured and butchered a family in a village near Hokkaido after the father of the family refused to storage drugs and weapons in his home on the order of the Yakuza. All four members of the family were tortured to death by knives and cleavers in their own home. &quot;Death by a thousand cuts.&quot; The three enforcers are currently on security detail at a high-sec private hospital. Time to be the long arm of justice 47.",
